e before admitting he's eleven.","src":"'Aurenne street kid. Steals for a living, lies for fun, and would die before admitting he\\'s eleven.'","n":1},{"f":"src/data/characters.js","l":52,"k":"Captain of the airship Halcyon. Smuggler, gambler, Dawnguard deserter. Owes everyone money, including himself.","src":"'Captain of the airship Halcyon. Smuggler, gambler, Dawnguard deserter. Owes everyone money, including himself.'","n":1},{"f":"src/data/content/ch10.js","l":8,"k":"Lemonade (with mint)","src":"'Lemonade (with mint)'","n":1},{"f":"src/data/content/ch10.js","l":8,"k":"Tomas's lemonade, for Bess. It has been on its way for forty years.","src":"'Tomas\\'s lemonade, for Bess. It has been on its way for forty years.'","n":1},{"f":"src/data/content/ch10.js","l":69,"k":"Shardling","src":"'Shardling'","n":1},{"f":"src/data/content/ch10.js","l":72,"k":"A splinter of the broken sun that learned to walk. It is warm, and it is not kind.","src":"'A splinter of the broken sun that learned to walk. It is warm, and it is not kind.'","n":1},{"f":"src/data/content/ch10.js","l":74,"k":"Noonhound","src":"'Noonhound'","n":1},{"f":"src/data/content/ch10.js","l":77,"k":"The Choir's hounds, bred in the Spire's light. They cast no shadow at all.","src":"'The Choir\\'s hounds, bred in the Spire\\'s light. They cast no shadow at all.'","n":1},{"f":"src/data/content/ch10.js","l":79,"k":"Glare","src":"'Glare'","n":2},{"f":"src/data/content/ch10.js","l":82,"k":"An eye of noon, floating. Looking at it is like looking at the sun, which nobody has done for a year.","src":"'An eye of noon, floating. Looking at it is like looking at the sun, which nobody has done for a year.'","n":1},{"f":"src/data/content/ch10.js","l":84,"k":"Vesper Lancer","src":"'Vesper Lancer'","n":1},{"f":"src/data/content/ch10.js","l":87,"k":"The Spire's guard. They have been promised the best day of their lives, as soon as their shift ends.","src":"'The Spire\\'s guard. They have been promised the best day of their lives, as soon as their shift ends.'","n":1},{"f":"src/data/content/ch10.js","l":89,"k":"Choir Seraph","src":"'Choir Seraph'","n":2},{"f":"src/data/content/ch10.js","l":92,"k":"A hymn given wings. It heals whatever stands between it and you.","src":"'A hymn given wings. It heals whatever stands between it and you.'","n":1},{"f":"src/data/content/ch10.js","l":97,"k":"Keeper of the Spire's back door. He has turned away four hundred pilgrims and remembers every face.","src":"'Keeper of the Spire\\'s back door. He has turned away four hundred pilgrims and remembers every face.'","n":1},{"f":"src/data/content/ch10.js","l":101,"k":"Hour Knight","src":"'Hour Knight'","n":1},{"f":"src/data/content/ch10.js","l":104,"k":"Armor wound like a clock. It stops when it is struck — and so, for a moment, do you.","src":"'Armor wound like a clock. It stops when it is struck — and so, for a moment, do you.'","n":1},{"f":"src/data/content/ch10.js","l":106,"k":"Stillwisp","src":"'Stillwisp'","n":1},{"f":"src/data/content/ch10.js","l":109,"k":"A moment that never ended, drifting. Cold as an afternoon that will not let you go home.","src":"'A moment that never ended, drifting. Cold as an afternoon that will not let you go home.'","n":1},{"f":"src/data/content/ch10.js","l":111,"k":"Memory Moth","src":"'Memory Moth'","n":2},{"f":"src/data/content/ch10.js","l":114,"k":"They eat memories the way other moths eat coats. The Spire is a feast.","src":"'They eat memories the way other moths eat coats. The Spire is a feast.'","n":1},{"f":"src/data/content/ch10.js","l":119,"k":"They practice the Vespersong in shifts. Somebody, somewhere in the Spire, is always singing it.","src":"'They practice the Vespersong in shifts. Somebody, somewhere in the Spire, is always singing it.'","n":1},{"f":"src/data/content/ch10.js","l":121,"k":"The Hour-Warden","src":"'The Hour-Warden'","n":1}]